# The engine's baked resources land here: ios/Tools/build-engine.sh copies
# them into Resources/engine, and the Xcode project carries this folder as a
# folder reference, so they ship in the app bundle at Resources/engine.
#
# They are not in this repository: they are 9.4 MB of measured tables and a
# compiled metallib, and ios/Tools/build-engine.sh produces them.
